Name: Chromium Paint Preview native recording serialization
URL: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/
Version: 132.0.6834.83
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: LICENSE

Source:
https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/tags/132.0.6834.83/components/paint_preview/common/

The following files are imported unchanged from the above Chromium tag:
  file_stream.h
  file_stream.cc
  serialized_recording.h
  serialized_recording.cc
  mojom/paint_preview_types_mojom_traits.h
  mojom/paint_preview_types_mojom_traits.cc

LICENSE is imported unchanged from Chromium's root LICENSE at the same tag.
The repository root LICENSE describes mini-electron's Apache-2.0 code and does
not replace the Chromium license for these imported files.

These native Mojo traits preserve Chromium's RecordingPersistence enum mapping
and move-only SerializedRecording file/BigBuffer union, including delegated
Mojo file and BigBuffer decoding and rejection of unknown enum/union values.
serialized_recording.cc retains the actual SkPicture serialization,
deserialization, capture-size limits, and asynchronous file destruction;
file_stream.cc provides its base::File-backed Skia streams.

Local Modifications: None.
